---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ArchiveLibrary from '../../components/ArchiveLibrary';
import {archive,events} from '../../lib/catalog';
---
<Layout title="Historical Drive study materials" active="Resources"><div class="page-top"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/resources/">Resources</a><span>/ Historical archive</span></div><h1>The Drive, made easier to browse.</h1><p>Find older study guides, practice tests, case studies and production tasks by competition. All 274 inventoried files are linked here, grouped into {archive.length} entries.</p></div><div class="archive-notice"><p><strong>Optional historical practice.</strong> Current Maryland and national guidelines take priority. These files’ contents, answers and reuse rights have not been independently verified; links open the originals.</p><p>“Former event name” follows the event catalogue’s checked aliases. “Related skill practice” means overlapping skills, not the same competition. General and unmatched materials stay visible. Collegiate (PBL) samples are labeled and excluded when filtering for a current high-school event.</p><p>Dates come from filenames, not a content review. Indexed October 27, 2026. Drive access is controlled by the collection’s owner.</p><a class="plain-link" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nO2RkQTGv4EXQ9myxirF8hmOUSd-d6zF" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open the original collection ↗</a></div><ArchiveLibrary client:load groups={archive} events={events.map(({id,name})=>({id,name}))}/><noscript><p>All material is listed above. Enable JavaScript to filter the archive; individual event materials pages also work without it.</p></noscript></Layout>
